# "Whenever a creature you control deals combat damage to a player, draw a card." Turn 1 Bot1 casts Enduring Curiosity and Mother of Runes
# (Island and four Moxen pay for both). Turn 3 both attack an empty board: each deals damage, so Bot1 draws twice (any creature you control,
# not only Curiosity). Turn 5 only Ornithopter (power 0) attacks: it deals no damage, so there is no event and no draw.

